% Two Hands (ability catalogue)
%
% A heavy sentinel machine stands on a bridge over an abyss. Two
% companions, one skill each, from a pool of eight catalogue skills. No
% skill takes it alone - not even when both companions hold it - and many
% pairs do, by two kinds of method.
%
%   overlook ~~gap~~ bridge (sentinel; the abyss below it)
%      |               |
%      +---- ledge ----+          (the team starts on the ledge)
%              |
%            ford (flooded)
%
% Two ways to take it out, each needing two different things:
%   drop it   it is heavy, and heavy wards forced movement: turn it to mist
%             (turnToMist - for a moment it is not heavy), then, while the
%             moment lasts, knock it into the abyss - a fireball or a
%             shield bash from the ledge, a tidal wave from the bridge
%             itself, a vortex on the abyss - or hook it across the gap
%             from the overlook, and it falls in
%   short it  it is a machine: soak it, then jolt it (lightningFlash, from
%             next door). Soak it where it stands with a wave (tidalWave),
%             or lure it into the ford (taunt, from the ford): it walks
%             after the taunter and arrives soaked
%
% Traps:
%   - any knock, hook or vortex alone: the sentinel is heavy and does not
%     budge; a hook on it drags the caster onto the bridge instead;
%   - a jolt on the dry machine only stuns it, and a stun is not out;
%   - the mist lasts one more cast: whoever mists cannot also knock;
%   - a taunt from the overlook breaks at once: it cannot walk the gap.
%
% Hypothesis (design.md): no single skill wins; 14 of 64 assignments do
% (7 pairs, either way round), by 7 methods; tidalWave plays two roles.

% === Map: four areas; the chokepoint is the gap to the overlook ===
region(ledge).
region(bridge).
region(overlook).
region(ford).
connected(ledge, bridge).
connected(ledge, overlook).
connected(ledge, ford).
gap(bridge, overlook).
lineOfSight(ledge, bridge).
lineOfSight(overlook, bridge).
lineOfSight(ford, bridge).
lineOfSight(ledge, ford).

% The abyss under the bridge: knocked in, anything that walks falls.
feature(bridge, abyss, chasm).
onEnter(ford, puddle).

% === Companions ===
role(player, player).
role(mage, companion).
at(player, ledge).
at(mage, ledge).
mana(player, 4).
mana(mage, 4).

% === The sentinel ===
role(sentinel, enemy).
at(sentinel, bridge).
tag(sentinel, machine).
tag(sentinel, heavy).

% === Default kit: one skill each (combos replans the whole matrix) ===
knows(player, turnToMist).
knows(mage, fireball).

win :- if(), do(neutralize(sentinel)).

funBlocker(sentinel).
funBlockerGoal(sentinel, neutralize(sentinel)).
funExpect(single_actor_plans, atMost, 0).

% === Choice: one skill each, from eight (htn_components combos) ===
comboSeat(player, 1).
comboSeat(mage, 1).
comboPool(turnToMist).
comboPool(fireball).
comboPool(tidalWave).
comboPool(shieldBash).
comboPool(vortex).
comboPool(hook).
comboPool(taunt).
comboPool(lightningFlash).
comboMinWins(12).
comboMinMethods(6).

goals(win).
